      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "point-1",
      "narration_text": "On the twenty-second, faculty reviewers assigned me maintenance of the Medhavy AI YouTube channel. I unlisted about ten videos that weren't explainer-style. And on the twenty-fifth, the format was approved.",
