    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "point-2",
      "narration_text": "I also tested GPU rendering. The RTX 5050 was visible in WSL, and NVENC encoded about twice as fast. But Manim's OpenGL renderer was about twenty-three percent slower than Cairo, so I didn't switch renderers.",
